# Every `.mjs` in this repository is test or tooling — `packages/*/test`, `battle-tests`, `scripts`.
# The library's source is TypeScript, so the language bar was reporting the suite instead of the
# product.
#
# `-linguist-detectable` rather than `linguist-vendored`: both take a file out of the statistics, and
# vendored also collapses it in a pull request's diff by default. `battle-tests` is where this
# project's adversarial work is written and read, and hiding it from review to tidy a bar chart
# trades the wrong thing. Nothing here is vendored either — it is all ours.
*.mjs -linguist-detectable
